  "body": "Fork synced at v0.18.0.\n\n## What changed\n- `site/content/guide/operations-edm.md`: new **Sinker EDM** overview (sinker machine, the Sinker electrode tool and its fields, sinker conditions, `edm.orbits` / `edm.max_orbit_radius`, post status, verification), then **Sinker Burn** and **Sinker Side Burn** sections in the Wire Contour section's shape: what each is for and when to choose it, settings by tab with seed defaults (from `sinker_op::burn_draft`, `sinker_side_op::seed_sinker_side_burn`, `sinker_page.rs` orbit rows), picks, and a **Sinker refusals** list quoted from `motion::sinker`, `sinker_side`, `sinker_orbit`, `operation::sinker_op`, `tools::electrode`, `tool_gate`, `commands/operation/gates.rs` and `posting_family::edm_at_post`. Title and description now say wire and sinker EDM; the wire headings are qualified (\"Wire EDM: the machine...\", \"Wire Contour refusals\").\n- `site/content/guide/operations.md`: a **Sinker EDM** row (Sinker Burn, Side Burn - the ribbon captions) and the reference link text.\n- `site/content/guide/machines.md`: the EDM kind row and the stale \"The sinker EDM kind admits no operation yet\" sentence now name the two sinker kinds.\n\nKinds covered: every EDM kind in `KindInfo::ALL` on main - Wire Contour (already documented), Sinker Burn, Sinker Side Burn.\n\n## How tested\n- `~/.local/bin/zola build` (0.23.6) in `site/`: green, 42 pages, 0 orphans; the `#sinker-edm` anchor resolves.\n- Every UI label grepped from `crates/ui/src/egui_app/sinker_page.rs`, `pages.rs`, `op_tabs.rs`; every refusal quoted from source.\n\n## Not exercised\n- No app run or screenshots; toolpath pictures per kind remain on #1250.\n\nChangelog: none\n\nRefs #1250\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
